This local project contains a snapshot of the locally modified Codex-web
system sources. The original Apache License 2.0 is included in LICENSE.
SOURCE_SNAPSHOT.json records the source paths and hashes before changes.

Changes in this project (2026-10-19): independent launch entry points,
independent terminology database and session output, a new three-column
translation interface, and browser scripts adapted for this interface.
Pretrained model weights are external dependencies and are not redistributed
in this folder. Their original licenses continue to apply.
